rtailcat statically links the 'tailcat' Go library (module github.com/tailscale/tailcat, pinned by commit in src/go/go.mod) and the Go runtime and standard library into its shared object. The exact module versions and checksums are recorded in src/go/go.mod and src/go/go.sum. Each module's full license text is included in its source tree (for example in src/go/vendor/<module>/ after running tools/vendor.sh).

